4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n-QpXJzndYAQ7kNvwEAou4K&_nc_oc=AdrriNkrpAWOOYsV5CMY3tYDbWPD6B_MMGqdI21YGxYCFLKdeqCimPota_-gCE_kIu8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af87dANmxeg-a7rI3g9YEFyaPsDEGU-nK2xXG_AWbHBjgA&oe=6A3E78D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4x_d5hJzNp0Q7kNvwFtIiFa&_nc_oc=AdogEp6Vw8IBV7D3uX5EYpMsplIJ1uYOPk0jpD5um8IBxOZMBInFynEdrlmgD2DKfxs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Ai1VovALYRgHpRkofzavS2ECtiz-2EgeHNzd6ihrgrQ&oe=6A3E7DB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3cdk32EIAtkQ7kNvwEg6Al1&_nc_oc=AdoIlaiK80F_blObfzwGeqAqL-BvIJJfbAoeFBjUhjz_dUMc1C_qxZl7bb6UjgQzaeg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8hnNj71YmrAJ76so3v2wUvNOYUYyUN7xVE3KLESKtXHw&oe=6A3E8B55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p